# Binary ChromaDB vector index - rebuilt on deploy from data/processed/chunks.jsonl
# (see src/embed_store.py rebuild_from_chunks_file). Never commit this: it's a
# memory-mapped HNSW structure that can leak uninitialized process memory into
# the file's padding bytes - this is how a Google API key ended up committed
# in data_level0.bin and got flagged by GitHub secret scanning.
data/chroma_db/
